forcement","stage":"Reinforcement","order":13,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating an object's ownership (inanimate with 's)","grammar":"Noun + 's + noun (canlı olmayan için de kullanılabilir)","highlights":"Nesnenin iyelik hali","pattern":"","en":"The city's streets are very clean.","tr":"Şehrin sokakları çok temiz.","ipa":"/ðə ˈsɪtiz strits ɑr ˈvɛri klin/","trPron":"Dı sİtiz strits ar veri klin","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"city's streets, streets are","synonyms":"town, metropolis","antonyms":"village, none","commonMistake":"The streets of the city are clean. ✔️ (doğru da)","aiExplain":"Cansız nesneler için de 's kullanılabilir.","grammarTags":"possessive, apostrophe, inanimate","imgQuery":"clean city street"},{"id":"A1-M05-P2-014","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P2","part":"P2 Reinforcement","stage":"Reinforcement","order":14,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating ownership with plural names (s')","grammar":"Plural name + ' + noun","highlights":"Çoğul isimlerde iyelik","pattern":"","en":"My parents' car is blue.","tr":"Annem babamın arabası mavi.","ipa":"/maɪ ˈpɛrənts kɑr ɪz blu/","trPron":"May perınts kar iz blu","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"parents' car, car is","synonyms":"vehicle, automobile","antonyms":"none","commonMistake":"My parent's car is blue. ❌ (tek bir ebeveyn)","aiExplain":"Çoğul isimlerde iyelik için kesme işareti S'den SONRA gelir.","grammarTags":"possessive, plural, apostrophe","imgQuery":"blue car in driveway"},{"id":"A1-M05-P2-015","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P2","part":"P2 Reinforcement","stage":"Reinforcement","order":15,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating a family relationship (our)","grammar":"Our + noun + are + adjective","highlights":"Bizim ...","pattern":"","en":"Our grandparents are very kind.","tr":"Büyük anne babamız çok kibar.","ipa":"/ˈaʊər ˈgrænˌpɛrənts ɑr ˈvɛri kaɪnd/","trPron":"Auır grenperınts ar veri kaynd","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"our 