1-M05-P2-024","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P2","part":"P2 Reinforcement","stage":"Reinforcement","order":24,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating a relationship with 's (two people)","grammar":"Name1 and Name2 + 's + noun (joint ownership)","highlights":"Birlikte sahiplik","pattern":"Happy","en":"Ortak sahiplikte sadece ikinci isme 's eklenir.","tr":"weding invitation with two names","ipa":"wedding music sound","trPron":"possessive, joint-ownership, names","tense":"","collocations":"","synonyms":"","antonyms":"","commonMistake":"A1-M05","aiExplain":"","grammarTags":""},{"id":"A1-M05-P2-025","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P2","part":"P2 Reinforcement","stage":"Reinforcement","order":25,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating separate ownership (each has own)","grammar":"Name1's and Name2's + plural noun (separate)","highlights":"Ayrı sahiplik","pattern":"","en":"Ali's and Ahmet's bags are different.","tr":"Ali'nin ve Ahmet'in çantaları farklı.","ipa":"/ˈɑliz ænd ˈɑːhmɛts bægz ɑr ˈdɪfərənt/","trPron":"Aliz end Ahmet's bags ar difırınt","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"Ali's and Ahmet's, bags are","synonyms":"unlike, dissimilar","antonyms":"same, similar","commonMistake":"Ali and Ahmet's bags are different. ❌ (joint ownership)","aiExplain":"Ayrı sahiplikte her iki isme de 's eklenir.","grammarTags":"possessive, separate-ownership, names","imgQuery":"two different bags side by side"}]